{
  "ALL_TEXT": "144 EXT. SULOCHANA'S BUILDING - NIGHT \nVEDA is dropping off SULOCHANA, as GOVARDHAN and the BUM wait \non the extravagant looking bike. \nVEDA \nMalli kalusthaavaa? \nSULOCHANA \nEnti poddunna lopu inko accident \nchesi vastaava..? \nVEDA giggles \nVEDA \nMalli aa baba daggariki teesukuni \nveltaava? \nSULOCHANA tries to hold back a smile \nVEDA \n(smiles) \nCinema ki veldaama? \nSULOCHANA doesn\u2019t react \nVEDA \nPoni dinner? \nSULOCHANA \nNaato paatu vipassana ki vastaava? \nVEDA \nooru avatala undhe meditation \ncentre ana? padi rojulu evaru \nevaritho maatladukokunda dhaiyyal \nla dhyaanam chestaaru kada.. \nSULOCHANA Laughs \nSULOCHANA \nAvunu \nVEDA \nNaavalla kaadu \nSULOCHANA \nDate annaavu kada pada kalisi \nveldaam \nGOVARDHAN \nMee sollu aapithe nenu intiki velli \nsnaanam chesi battalu maarchukovali \nSULOCHANA gives him a peck on the cheek, and leaves. \nSULOCHANA walks back, a twinkle in her eye and a swing in her \nstep. She is about to climb the elevator, when the \nILLEGITIMATE SON, red-eyed, enters the frame. He sobs \nheavily, holding tears back. He drops a bouquet and a chart \nbox, and runs away. SULOCHANA opens the box, and unfurls a \nscrolled-up old parchment.. \nCUT TO:",
